{
    "_comment": [
        "Pictures for the Season 3/4 rewind list. tools/make_pictures.py cuts each source (a texture from the",
        "game's own archives, or with 'file' an image next to this file: the Season 4 scene screenshots) to the",
        "season's kind of picture and writes twdr_<key>.d3dtx: 'strip' (Season 3, the picture strip of its More",
        "Options window) or 'background' (Season 4, the picture of the stock picture popup).",
        "'steps' maps episode -> scene table entry (TWDRewindScenes.lua, 1-based) to a picture; 'labels' maps a",
        "scene table label to one; 'episodes' is the picture for anything without one (the restart, saved points).",
        "A value starting with @ is a texture the game already has and is used as is.",
        "Source options: cx/cy = centre of the crop (0..1), zoom = crop this much tighter,",
        "fit = scale the whole image to zoom x the picture width (cut-out paintings), bright = brightness factor."
    ],
